    <decisions>
        <name>Note_Found</name>
        <label>메모·마스킹본 있음?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Assign_No_Note</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>없음</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Note_Has_Sanitized</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Meeting_Note</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Meeting_Note.Sanitized_Content__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsBlank</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Opportunity</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>있음</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Post_Succeeded</name>
        <label>전송 성공?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Assign_Post_Failed</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>실패</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Post_OK</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varPostSuccess</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Assign_Post_Success</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>성공</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>백로그 28: 미팅 메모(마스킹본) 1건을 받아 프롬프트 템플릿 Meeting_Summary(27)로 요약을 만들고 내부 상품팀 Slack 채널(#상품팀-검토)에 게시한다. 입력 meetingNoteId(+선택 meetingLog). Opportunity_Meeting_Log_To_Slack(자동) 또는 26/30 Flow에서 Subflow로 호출. 원문(Raw_Content__c)은 조회·전송하지 않는다.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Slack 메시지 헤더 — 기업명·딜명·미팅일·RM(내부 채널이므로 최소 맥락 허용)</description>
        <name>fmtHeader</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;📝 *미팅 요약* | &quot; &amp; {!Get_Opportunity.Account.Name} &amp; &quot; | 딜: &quot; &amp; {!Get_Opportunity.Name} &amp; &quot; | 미팅일 &quot; &amp; TEXT(DATEVALUE({!Get_Meeting_Note.CreatedDate})) &amp; &quot; | RM &quot; &amp; BLANKVALUE({!Get_Owner.Name}, &quot;-&quot;) &amp; BR() &amp; &quot;_(마스킹 &quot; &amp; TEXT(BLANKVALUE({!Get_Meeting_Note.Masked_Count__c}, 0)) &amp; &quot;건 처리된 메모 &quot; &amp; {!Get_Meeting_Note.Name} &amp; &quot; 기준 · 원문 미포함)_&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>프롬프트 입력은 null 을 거부하므로 미팅 로그가 비어 있으면 기본 문구를 전달</description>
        <name>fmtMeetingLog</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(ISBLANK({!meetingLog}), &quot;(미팅 로그 없음 — 메모만 근거로 작성)&quot;, {!meetingLog})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fmtSlackMessage</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!fmtHeader} &amp; BR() &amp; BR() &amp; {!summaryText}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Meeting_Summary_To_Slack {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>미팅 요약 → 상품팀 Slack 전송</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
